  "instructions": [
    "For the acid-adjusted orange juice, dissolve 3 g citric acid and 2 g malic acid in 100 ml freshly squeezed orange juice.",
    "Use a fat 3/4 oz of the acid-adjusted orange juice, given as 25 ml in the source.",
    "Dry shake all ingredients for about 30 seconds to emulsify the egg white, then shake with ice.",
